			"notes": "## ThirdCross 1.1.0\n\nCrosshair rendering now uses Minecraft's vanilla crosshair rendering pipeline.\n\n### Improved\n- Improved compatibility with zoom and camera mods.\n- Improved crosshair behavior when switching between first-person and third-person perspectives.\n\n### Fixed\n- Fixed the vanilla attack indicator not rendering correctly.\n- Fixed rendering compatibility with mods that modify or wrap Minecraft's vanilla crosshair."
